# The player's recenter = calibration (#28, D-018, D-019): run by scripts/dev/recenter-check.ps1, which
# samples status.json in the windows named below and judges the head numbers.
# Calibrated standing at the start; the head sits down (40 cm lower), moves and turns; the left stick
# click is held for a second (a long press: recenter = calibrate seated); the head goes back to where it
# started. Frames at 90 Hz.

timeline gameplay

@270 shot start                       # 3 s after the level is playable: past its fade-in
@300 head pos 0.25 -0.40 0.10         # sat down: 25 cm right, 40 cm lower, 10 cm back
@300 head rot 40 0 0                  # turned 40 degrees left
                                      # window "seated": frames 330-370
@380 action thumbstick_click left 1   # hold the left stick click for 90 frames (1 s; a long press is 0.5 s)
@470 action thumbstick_click left 0
                                      # window "recentered": frames 490-530
@500 shot recentered
@540 head pos 0 0 0                   # back where the first reference was taken
@540 head rot 0 0 0
                                      # window "back": frames 570-610
@580 shot back
